Package: bongocat-studio
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35), libgcc-s1
Recommends: libxkbcommon0
Maintainer: Arvian <divarvian@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/divarvian/bongocat-studio
Description: Pure Rust desktop control center and OBS overlay server for Bongo Cat
 BongoCat Studio is a standalone Pure Rust desktop application and built-in
 OBS Studio Browser Source server for Linux (Wayland and X11). It features
 Slanted, Flat Desk, and Classic visual modes, 10-finger ergonomic typing,
 clickpad gestures, real-time OBS config sync, and privacy controls.
